I Became Engulfed by Desire...

1191
00:03:05,017 --> 00:03:07,867
<i>I can't believe Lady Catarina 
asked me to study with her.</i>

1192
00:03:07,867 --> 00:03:10,427
<i>And she's sitting so close to me!</i>

1193
00:03:10,427 --> 00:03:11,387
Mary...

1194
00:03:11,877 --> 00:03:14,137
I don't know how to do this one.

1195
00:03:14,227 --> 00:03:16,437
Oh, I'm sorry.

1196
00:03:16,437 --> 00:03:19,407
I don't know how to do that one, either.

1197
00:03:19,407 --> 00:03:22,217
Maybe we should ask the president, then.

1198
00:03:24,087 --> 00:03:26,647
And that's how you arrive at the answer.

1199
00:03:26,647 --> 00:03:28,757
Oh, I get it!

1200
00:03:28,757 --> 00:03:31,617
I understand now. You're a great teacher, President Sirius.

1201
00:03:31,937 --> 00:03:34,027
There are several reference books

1202
00:03:34,027 --> 00:03:36,547
on this in the east building's library.

1203
00:03:36,547 --> 00:03:39,707
They're available to borrow, so maybe you should go there.

1204
00:03:39,707 --> 00:03:43,037
We'll do that, President. Thank you!

1205
00:03:45,427 --> 00:03:47,607
I'm honored that I could be of help.

1206
00:03:48,867 --> 00:03:51,187
The library in the east building...

1207
00:03:51,187 --> 00:03:52,917
I've never been there before.

1208
00:03:52,917 --> 00:03:54,357
Neither have I.

1209
00:03:54,357 --> 00:03:57,087
I guess it's differentfrom the usual library.

1210
00:03:57,087 --> 00:03:58,087
Hello.

1211
00:03:59,097 --> 00:04:00,717
Where are you two headed?

1212
00:04:00,717 --> 00:04:02,927
Geordo-sama, how do you do?

1213
00:04:02,927 --> 00:04:05,537
We're on our way to the library in the east building.

1214
00:04:05,537 --> 00:04:06,827
That's perfect.

1215
00:04:06,827 --> 00:04:09,267
I was thinking of going there myself.

1216
00:04:09,267 --> 00:04:10,197
May I join you?

1217
00:04:10,197 --> 00:04:11,697
Of course.

1218
00:04:11,937 --> 00:04:14,037
Mary, do you take issue with that?

1219
00:04:14,037 --> 00:04:16,947
N-Not at all. Please, do accompany us.

1220
00:04:17,327 --> 00:04:21,577
<i>Just when I thought I'd get some 
time alone with Lady Catarina...</i>

1221
00:04:21,577 --> 00:04:23,517
Sister, where are you off to?

1222
00:04:23,517 --> 00:04:24,747
The library.

1223
00:04:24,747 --> 00:04:27,657
Oh? Maybe I'll come with you.

1224
00:04:29,547 --> 00:04:31,717
The library? What a coincidence.

1225
00:04:31,717 --> 00:04:32,917
I'm going there, too.

1226
00:04:32,917 --> 00:04:34,797
I'll join you, too!

1227
00:04:34,797 --> 00:04:36,747
Oh! I'd love to join you!

1228
00:04:39,767 --> 00:04:42,937
<i>Everyone ended up joining us...</i>

1229
00:04:43,047 --> 00:04:44,517
Darn it all!

1230
00:04:47,987 --> 00:04:51,217
Please, Catarina-sama, have a seat right here.

1231
00:04:51,217 --> 00:04:53,127
I'll sit next to you.

1232
00:04:59,317 --> 00:05:03,207
I-I'm sorry! I guess I'm a little hungry...

1233
00:05:03,207 --> 00:05:05,097
Shall I go and get some sweets?

1234
00:05:05,097 --> 00:05:06,537
Thanks, Maria!

1235
00:05:06,537 --> 00:05:08,897
I-I'll help you.

1236
00:05:08,897 --> 00:05:11,367
I'll bring the best tea you've ever had.

1237
00:05:11,367 --> 00:05:12,707
Thanks, Mary!

1238
00:05:14,207 --> 00:05:15,767
Just leave it to me!

1239
00:05:24,977 --> 00:05:26,887
<i>It all looks like sweets!</i>

1240
00:05:33,607 --> 00:05:36,377
Did this just shine for a second?

1241
00:05:48,747 --> 00:05:49,607
What's going on?!

1242
00:05:49,607 --> 00:05:50,957
I-It's so bright...

1243
00:05:51,297 --> 00:05:52,957
What is that light?

1244
00:06:11,347 --> 00:06:13,337
Did you see that?

1245
00:06:13,707 --> 00:06:14,857
Yes...

1246
00:06:15,167 --> 00:06:17,237
They all just disappeared...

1247
00:06:17,847 --> 00:06:20,207
...into the book?

1248
00:06:26,427 --> 00:06:28,537
This is ancient script.

1249
00:06:28,537 --> 00:06:31,697
It says... "A Tale by the Name of..."

1250
00:06:31,697 --> 00:06:33,237
..."Desire"?

1251
00:06:34,497 --> 00:06:36,747
"When one's desire is fulfilled..."

1252
00:06:36,747 --> 00:06:39,627
"...those captured may be saved."

1253
00:06:40,537 --> 00:06:42,187
Let's try and read it.

1254
00:06:42,187 --> 00:06:43,047
Right.

1255
00:06:49,967 --> 00:06:51,957
Catarina-sama?!

1256
00:06:51,957 --> 00:06:53,477
Catarina-sama!

1257
00:06:54,467 --> 00:06:55,557
Is this...

1258
00:06:56,447 --> 00:06:58,937
the world within the book?

1259
00:07:00,137 --> 00:07:04,087
It looks like we can't interfere 
with the world in the book.

1260
00:07:04,087 --> 00:07:06,547
What in the world is going on?

1261
00:07:10,867 --> 00:07:12,577
Come, this way.

1262
00:07:14,007 --> 00:07:16,507
Why am I dressed like this?

1263
00:07:16,507 --> 00:07:18,917
I was just in the library a moment ago...

1264
00:07:29,147 --> 00:07:32,597
Well, now that the wedding is over,

1265
00:07:32,597 --> 00:07:36,097
you finally belong to me alone.

1266
00:07:36,097 --> 00:07:37,597
Wedding?

1267
00:07:37,597 --> 00:07:39,697
So this is a wedding dress?!

1268
00:07:40,057 --> 00:07:42,647
No one will be coming here 
for the rest of the night.

1269
00:07:48,247 --> 00:07:51,627
You'll be alone with me until morning.

1270
00:07:51,627 --> 00:07:54,047
What?! I can't do that!

1271
00:07:54,047 --> 00:07:56,617
I have to study for my test!

1272
00:07:56,877 --> 00:08:00,657
Your face couldn't possibly look any cuter.

1273
00:08:01,277 --> 00:08:04,027
It makes me want to make 
you even more uncomfortable.

1274
00:08:04,027 --> 00:08:07,337
U-Um... Geordo-sama?

1275
00:08:17,247 --> 00:08:21,567
Shall I start by taking those lips of yours?

1276
00:08:26,477 --> 00:08:32,037
H-Honestly, I'd prefer 
some sweets over wine...

1277
00:08:32,967 --> 00:08:36,057
Wh-What in the world is going on here?!

1278
00:08:36,057 --> 00:08:38,377
I can't bear to see any more!

1279
00:08:38,527 --> 00:08:42,497
Geordo-sama, what do you think 
you're doing to my Catarina-sama?!

1280
00:08:42,497 --> 00:08:45,377
Was that an illusion the book 
was showing us?

1281
00:08:45,377 --> 00:08:48,887
Or is it really happening inside the book?

1282
00:08:48,887 --> 00:08:52,517
Whether it's real or an illusion, 
I won't stand for it!

1283
00:08:52,637 --> 00:08:56,407
What can I do to rescue Catarina-sama?

1284
00:08:56,407 --> 00:08:58,447
Let's open the book one more time.

1285
00:09:05,087 --> 00:09:06,707
Sister, wake up.

1286
00:09:07,727 --> 00:09:09,077
Keith...

1287
00:09:09,237 --> 00:09:12,037
Come on, pick up your pen 
and face your desk.

1288
00:09:12,317 --> 00:09:17,297
Huh? I'm suddenly back in my own room?

1289
00:09:22,377 --> 00:09:23,897
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

1290
00:09:23,897 --> 00:09:25,897
<i>Keith is acting weird today!</i>

1291
00:09:25,897 --> 00:09:28,047
<i>And he's giving off an oddly sexy vibe...</i>

1292
00:09:28,617 --> 00:09:30,857
You'd better get your studying done...

1293
00:09:32,007 --> 00:09:35,537
or I'll eat this.

1294
00:09:37,807 --> 00:09:39,907
My sweets! Give that to me!

1295
00:09:39,907 --> 00:09:42,677
Then... open wide.

1296
00:09:42,677 --> 00:09:43,357
Huh?!

1297
00:09:44,497 --> 00:09:47,527
"Ah..."

1298
00:09:50,707 --> 00:09:53,157
Ah...

1299
00:09:53,157 --> 00:09:55,787
No!

1300
00:09:55,787 --> 00:09:59,247
I absolutely, positively won't 
let anyone feed Catarina-sama!

1301
00:09:59,417 --> 00:10:03,427
It was a story about Keith-sama 
and Catarina-sama this time...

1302
00:10:04,137 --> 00:10:06,697
"A Tale by the Name of Desire"...

1303
00:10:06,697 --> 00:10:10,097
So that was Geordo-sama's 
desire we saw before,

1304
00:10:10,097 --> 00:10:12,567
and this was Keith-sama's desire?

1305
00:10:12,567 --> 00:10:13,257
Huh?!

1306
00:10:13,567 --> 00:10:16,677
Come to think of it, I do remember hearing

1307
00:10:16,677 --> 00:10:18,387
that somewhere in this school,

1308
00:10:18,387 --> 00:10:21,667
there's a magic book that craves the desires of humans.

1309
00:10:21,667 --> 00:10:24,617
I've heard that before, too.

1310
00:10:24,617 --> 00:10:27,867
It was one of this school's seven mysteries.

1311
00:10:28,097 --> 00:10:31,927
This book was written long before 
this school was established,

1312
00:10:31,927 --> 00:10:34,457
but it looks like a brand new book...

1313
00:10:34,457 --> 00:10:38,447
and that's because it prolongs its 
life by feeding on human desires

1314
00:10:38,447 --> 00:10:40,017
as its energy source.

1315
00:10:43,297 --> 00:10:46,807
Hey! What do we have to do 
to get them all out of you?!

1316
00:10:48,757 --> 00:10:50,377
Tell me!

1317
00:10:50,377 --> 00:10:52,627
Mary-sama, please, calm down!

1318
00:10:54,067 --> 00:10:55,267
In the preface, it says,

1319
00:10:55,267 --> 00:10:59,097
"When one's desire is fulfilled, those captured may be saved."

1320
00:10:59,707 --> 00:11:02,487
So if the desire of one of the people in it is fulfilled,

1321
00:11:02,487 --> 00:11:05,567
they would all be able to return here, right?

1322
00:11:05,567 --> 00:11:10,327
You mean they all have to live out their desires in full?

1323
00:11:10,327 --> 00:11:11,277
Wait!

1324
00:11:11,527 --> 00:11:14,297
They all love Catarina-sama,

1325
00:11:14,297 --> 00:11:16,907
which means their desires would be...

1326
00:11:17,167 --> 00:11:20,947
to do all kinds of things to Catarina-sama?!

1327
00:11:21,107 --> 00:11:23,387
No way!

1328
00:11:24,657 --> 00:11:26,527
No way!

1329
00:11:26,527 --> 00:11:28,997
Well, we need to open the book, or nothing will...

1330
00:11:28,997 --> 00:11:31,927
No! I don't want to see any of that!

1331
00:11:31,927 --> 00:11:36,297
But if we don't, they'll all be trapped in the book forever!

1332
00:11:36,407 --> 00:11:38,597
I know, but...

1333
00:11:40,387 --> 00:11:42,527
It's all right, Mary-sama.

1334
00:11:42,527 --> 00:11:44,197
I'm here with you.

1335
00:11:44,197 --> 00:11:46,187
We may be in a bad situation,

1336
00:11:46,187 --> 00:11:49,407
but let's work together 
to find the best way to fix it.

1337
00:11:49,407 --> 00:11:50,677
Maria-san...

1338
00:11:54,547 --> 00:11:58,467
Catarina-sama, I've found another interesting book.

1339
00:11:58,467 --> 00:12:01,837
Wow, all of these look interesting!

1340
00:12:01,837 --> 00:12:02,747
Wait... huh?

1341
00:12:02,997 --> 00:12:06,127
Why am I in your personal library?

1342
00:12:06,127 --> 00:12:07,677
Don't you like it?

1343
00:12:07,827 --> 00:12:09,587
Oh, I do!

1344
00:12:09,587 --> 00:12:12,057
All the books in here 
are books I'd love to read!

1345
00:12:12,057 --> 00:12:13,427
I wish I could live here!

1346
00:12:14,127 --> 00:12:17,137
Catarina-sama... O-Of course!

1347
00:12:17,137 --> 00:12:19,557
I'm prepared...

1348
00:12:22,997 --> 00:12:25,457
to start living with you at any time!

1349
00:12:25,457 --> 00:12:27,157
S-Sophia?

1350
00:12:27,317 --> 00:12:32,197
Because, Catarina-sama, I...

1351
00:12:32,197 --> 00:12:35,067
l-lo... lo...

1352
00:12:35,207 --> 00:12:36,947
I love you, too, Sophia!

1353
00:12:37,157 --> 00:12:38,537
You mean it?!

1354
00:12:38,537 --> 00:12:42,167
How much?! Which do you love more, me or sweets?!

1355
00:12:42,167 --> 00:12:45,417
Huh? W-Well, of course, I...

1356
00:12:49,667 --> 00:12:53,827
I can't believe Sophia-sama slammed
 Catarina-sama against a wall!

1357
00:12:53,827 --> 00:12:56,247
She even told her she l-loved her...

1358
00:12:56,247 --> 00:12:58,047
The next one! Let's try the next one!

1359
00:13:00,097 --> 00:13:03,237
What's all this? Where am I this time?

1360
00:13:06,937 --> 00:13:08,907
May I have this dance?

1361
00:13:17,117 --> 00:13:18,747
<i>Who are you?</i>

1362
00:13:19,897 --> 00:13:22,627
<i>Black hair, black eyes...</i>

1363
00:13:22,627 --> 00:13:24,437
<i>And the way he's dressed...</i>

1364
00:13:26,687 --> 00:13:29,297
<i>Is this... the Devilish Count?</i>

1365
00:13:32,197 --> 00:13:33,417
Nicol?!

1366
00:13:34,107 --> 00:13:35,557
It's Nicol-sama!

1367
00:13:39,047 --> 00:13:40,427
Nicol-sama!

1368
00:13:42,907 --> 00:13:44,227
What now?

1369
00:13:58,477 --> 00:14:00,557
We're saved!

1370
00:14:00,937 --> 00:14:04,887
Um, Nicol-sama, which way is the school?

1371
00:14:04,887 --> 00:14:07,167
I need to get back to the library.

1372
00:14:07,667 --> 00:14:09,367
I'm hungry, too.

1373
00:14:20,267 --> 00:14:22,227
I don't want to let you go.

1374
00:14:23,387 --> 00:14:25,307
I want to keep you...

1375
00:14:25,917 --> 00:14:27,577
trapped in these arms forever.

1376
00:14:30,457 --> 00:14:32,377
Let's burn this book!

1377
00:14:32,377 --> 00:14:34,157
Mary-sama, please calm down!

1378
00:14:34,157 --> 00:14:36,977
Are these things really what they're all thinking?!

1379
00:14:36,977 --> 00:14:40,697
It may be that the magic is making 
their desires rage out of control!

1380
00:14:40,697 --> 00:14:42,417
We still have to see more?!

1381
00:14:42,487 --> 00:14:44,197
Wasn't that enough?!

1382
00:14:46,337 --> 00:14:48,867
It looks like that wasn't enough.

1383
00:14:48,867 --> 00:14:50,427
If that's what it wants...

1384
00:14:50,647 --> 00:14:54,547
I'll face down this desire 
or whatever else it wants me to!

1385
00:15:02,707 --> 00:15:04,167
Mary-sama?

1386
00:15:04,167 --> 00:15:08,217
After all this, I don't even need to read it. 
I can guess what's going to happen.

1387
00:15:08,347 --> 00:15:10,187
This is just awful...

1388
00:15:10,857 --> 00:15:14,767
But the one it's hurting the most is Catarina-sama.

1389
00:15:14,767 --> 00:15:17,507
She left all these sweets here, untouched.

1390
00:15:17,507 --> 00:15:20,287
And I'm sure she must 
be quite hungry by now...

1391
00:15:21,937 --> 00:15:23,267
That's it!

1392
00:15:23,267 --> 00:15:27,567
None of the stories we've seen so far 
have been about Catarina-sama's desire.

1393
00:15:28,327 --> 00:15:29,837
Yes, you're right.

1394
00:15:30,107 --> 00:15:34,367
"When one's desire is fulfilled, those captured may be saved."

1395
00:15:34,367 --> 00:15:37,557
So if Catarina-sama's desire is fulfilled...

1396
00:15:37,557 --> 00:15:39,347
They'll all be set free!

1397
00:15:39,667 --> 00:15:42,607
We'll just have to stake all our hopes on that!

1398
00:15:46,587 --> 00:15:48,757
I'm so hungry.

1399
00:15:48,757 --> 00:15:51,647
How do I get back to the library?

1400
00:15:51,647 --> 00:15:54,567
I want to eat Maria's sweets!

1401
00:15:54,567 --> 00:15:56,807
I want to drink Mary's tea!

1402
00:15:56,917 --> 00:15:59,247
Catarina-sama, the sweets are right here!

1403
00:15:59,247 --> 00:16:01,097
And so is the tea!

1404
00:16:01,097 --> 00:16:04,027
It's a pity we can't bring them to her.

1405
00:16:06,307 --> 00:16:08,457
Sweets!

1406
00:16:09,847 --> 00:16:14,187
Wow! The whole thing is made of sweets!

1407
00:16:16,277 --> 00:16:17,967
Yum!

1408
00:16:20,897 --> 00:16:23,087
This is great!

1409
00:16:26,627 --> 00:16:27,997
<i>Incredible!</i>

1410
00:16:27,997 --> 00:16:29,727
<i>I can still eat more!</i>

1411
00:16:29,727 --> 00:16:31,567
<i>I can eat all I want!</i>

1412
00:16:32,097 --> 00:16:33,737
<i>Strange...</i>

1413
00:16:33,737 --> 00:16:35,847
<i>No matter how much I eat, it's not enough.</i>

1414
00:16:35,967 --> 00:16:38,307
<i>I want more! More, more!</i>

1415
00:16:38,307 --> 00:16:39,147
More! More! More! More! More! More! More! More! More!

1416
00:16:38,307 --> 00:16:46,617


1417
00:16:39,147 --> 00:16:39,547
More! More! More! More! More! More! More! More! More!

1418
00:16:39,547 --> 00:16:40,167
More! More! More! More! More! More! More! More! More!

1419
00:16:40,167 --> 00:16:40,667
More! More! More! More! More! More! More! More! More!

1420
00:16:40,667 --> 00:16:40,997
More! More! More! More! More! More! More! More! More!

1421
00:16:40,997 --> 00:16:41,577
More! More! More! More! More! More! More! More! More!

1422
